; M26 - the Maelstrom's pacing, and nothing else. Starting values from
; .kiro/specs/milestone-m26-maelstrom/design.md section 3; tune in play, not in review.
;
; A cap of 10 hulls in the last band is above M25's tier-5 heat cap of 8, which is
; itself unverified on a phone - flagged in the M26 checkpoint.

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="band_0"]
